   {
    "id": 127440410,
    "author": {
     "country": "United States",
     "countryCode": "US",
     "fullName": "Hailey"
    },
    "title": "",
    "message": "Wow, how to put this day in words!! My boyfriend and I booked a helicopter glacier tour with paddle boarding on GetYourGuide. It was worth every cent. From the second we walked into Alaska Helicopter Tours we were treated with friendly faces. All the people checking us in and helping us with the safety video were very kind. We then got into our dry suits, thanks to Kaiden, and excitedly waited for our tour to begin. The pilots we had were amazing! We got to see the beautiful knik glacier from above and we felt very safe. Now the actual tour! Our guides were Timothy and Taval. They went above and beyond to give us an amazing time. We got to swim in the pools, paddle board around them, and also explore the glacier. This experience is a once in a lifetime opportunity and our guides literally made the trip. They were helpful with taking so many pictures and videos of us. It was so amazing, I can’t even describe it. If you are debating doing this activity, it’s worth every penny!",
