    "id": 123644774,
    "author": {
     "country": "Canada",
     "countryCode": "CA",
     "fullName": "Sophie"
    },
    "title": "",
    "message": "An absolute MUST do!! If you’re going to spend money on one thing make it this. We had the most amazing experience doing the helicopter ride and paddleboarding. Being one of the fist torus of the season it felt super special and the guides were beyond fabulous. Tom, Haylie and Taylor made it so fun, we were able to totally customise what we did with our time on the glacier and they helped us out with everything. All the guides were super knowledgeable about the glacier and shared all they knew which was super interesting. They showed us a “death hole” and a second paddle boarding pool where we were able to walk through a channel to get through. Everyone back at the base site and our pilots were super lovely and we couldn’t recommend this tour more!! Thank you for the lifelong memories!",
